{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.467,
  "audioFrames": 284,
  "duration": 302,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "老板刚在后台把价格改低，刷新页面，怎么还是旧价？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.41,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "顾客到底该信哪个？",
    "start": 5.69,
    "dur": 2.06,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "答案马上来。",
    "start": 8.03,
    "dur": 1.43,
    "src": "ch1-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-1": {
  "audioSec": 15.167,
  "audioFrames": 455,
  "duration": 464,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "原来你在页面上看到的价格，多半不是每次都去数据库里查的，而是读的另存的一份。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.95,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "把网站想成一家店的后厨：后面的大仓库里放着价目账本，这就是数据库，只有它算数。",
    "start": 7.23,
    "dur": 7.94,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-2": {
  "audioSec": 20.1,
  "audioFrames": 603,
  "duration": 621,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 464,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "热门菜提前摆在厨师手边的备菜台上，每盘插一张价签，台上这一份就叫缓存，常用的工具是 Redis。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.78,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "缓存和数据库的一致性，说的就是让这两份对得上：改价要动仓库和备菜台两个地方，它们没法在同一瞬间一起变，中间总有空隙。",
    "start": 9.043,
    "dur": 11.07,
    "src": "ch2-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-1": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "直接改价签行不行",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch3-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "最直接的想法：改完账本，顺手把台上的价签也改成新价，这叫更新缓存。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch3-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "update-1": {
  "audioSec": 17.4,
  "audioFrames": 522,
  "duration": 530,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "update",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "最直接的想法：改完账本，顺手把台上的价签也改成新价，这叫更新缓存。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.5,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "可要是有两位改价员前后脚改同一道菜，先改的那位路上慢了一步，最后摆上去的反而是他那张旧价签，台上就一直错下去。",
    "start": 6.78,
    "dur": 10.62,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "update-2": {
  "audioSec": 14.167,
  "audioFrames": 425,
  "duration": 444,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 530,
  "chapter": "update",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "没人点的冷门菜，也会被摆上台占地方。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 3.27,
    "src": "ch3-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "所以更常用的办法是撤盘：把那盘连价签一起撤走，不摆新的，这叫删缓存，等下次有人点，再去仓库照账本重新摆。",
    "start": 3.563,
    "dur": 10.62,
    "src": "ch3-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-2": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "先撤盘还是先改账本",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch4-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "那先撤盘，还是先改账本？",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch4-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "order-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.9,
  "audioFrames": 357,
  "duration": 365,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "那先撤盘，还是先改账本？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.72,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "先撤盘的话，厨师看台上空了，就跑去仓库，账本还没改，他抄回来的还是旧价，又把旧价那盘摆回了台上。",
    "start": 3.0,
    "dur": 8.9,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "order-2": {
  "audioSec": 19.233,
  "audioFrames": 577,
  "duration": 595,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 365,
  "chapter": "order",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "反过来，先改账本、再撤盘，出错的机会就小多了，这是最常见的做法。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 6.33,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "但它也会出错，只是很少：台上正好空着，厨师去仓库抄到旧价；这时新价才改进账本，台也撤了一遍；厨师这才回来，把旧价那盘摆上台。",
    "start": 6.623,
    "dur": 12.62,
    "src": "ch4-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-3": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "撤不干净怎么办",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch5-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "漏掉的旧盘怎么办？",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch5-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "patch-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.3,
  "audioFrames": 279,
  "duration": 287,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "patch",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "漏掉的旧盘怎么办？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.73,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "有一种补丁叫延迟双删：先撤盘，再改账本，过一会儿回头再撤一次。",
    "start": 2.01,
    "dur": 7.29,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "patch-2": {
  "audioSec": 11.333,
  "audioFrames": 340,
  "duration": 348,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 287,
  "chapter": "patch",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "撤盘那一下也可能手滑没撤成，这时靠消息队列重试：在待撤清单上记一笔，跑腿员照着清单反复去撤，直到撤掉。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 11.32,
    "src": "ch5-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "patch-3": {
  "audioSec": 11.133,
  "audioFrames": 334,
  "duration": 352,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 635,
  "chapter": "patch",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "还可以请一位巡视员盯着仓库的进出货流水账，这叫订阅变更日志：看到记了改价就去撤盘，业务代码不用管删缓存。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 11.13,
    "src": "ch5-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-4": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "分仓库慢半拍",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch6-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "很多网站还有分仓库，分仓库只照着抄，自己不改账；账本从总仓库抄送过去，这慢半拍就叫主从延迟。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch6-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "replica-1": {
  "audioSec": 19.667,
  "audioFrames": 590,
  "duration": 598,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "replica",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "很多网站还有分仓库，分仓库只照着抄，自己不改账；账本从总仓库抄送过去，这慢半拍就叫主从延迟。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 10.88,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "厨师图近，去分仓库抄价，那边还没收到新价，就算撤盘顺序全对，旧价还是被摆回了台上。",
    "start": 11.16,
    "dur": 8.51,
    "src": "ch6-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "replica-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.6,
  "audioFrames": 168,
  "duration": 186,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 598,
  "chapter": "replica",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "办法是补货时去总仓库抄价，或者等分仓库收到了再撤一次。",
    "start": 0.017,
    "dur": 5.59,
    "src": "ch6-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "card-5": {
  "card": true,
  "name": "兜底与取舍",
  "background": "#1E293B",
  "duration": 78,
  "origDuration": 0,
  "labelHold": 78,
  "holdAt": 0,
  "extraHold": 78,
  "insertBeforeSentence": "ch7-1",
  "insertBeforeText": "最后还有一道安全网：每盘都插一个计时牌，到点就撤，这叫过期时间，也就是 TTL，它保证旧菜不会永远摆在台上。",
  "sentences": [],
  "provisional": false,
  "note": "章节卡静音 78 帧（2.60 s），插在 ch7-1 句首之前（上一章章间停顿之后）"
 },
 "ttl-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.633,
  "audioFrames": 319,
  "duration": 328,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "ttl",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "最后还有一道安全网：每盘都插一个计时牌，到点就撤，这叫过期时间，也就是 TTL，它保证旧菜不会永远摆在台上。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 10.64,
    "src": "ch7-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "ttl-2": {
  "audioSec": 7.033,
  "audioFrames": 211,
  "duration": 219,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 328,
  "chapter": "ttl",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "想让台上和账本每一秒都一样，就得改价时全店停单，等全部改完再开门，太慢了。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.03,
    "src": "ch7-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "ttl-3": {
  "audioSec": 11.667,
  "audioFrames": 350,
  "duration": 369,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 547,
  "chapter": "ttl",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以常见的做法是允许旧一会儿，但保证最后一定变新，这叫最终一致。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.74,
    "src": "ch7-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "靠谱的系统结账时只看仓库账本，不看台上的价签。",
    "start": 7.017,
    "dur": 4.66,
    "src": "ch7-4"
   }
  ]
 },
